scope_conflict             | v1 reject: missing model value for (f x)              | v2 accept
scope_conflict_textkeys    | v1 reject: assertion is false: (let ((x b)) (= (f x) b)) | v2 accept
scope_conflict_wrong       | v1 reject: missing model value for (f x)              | v2 reject: assertion is false: (let ((x b)) (= (f x) b))
single_let                 | v1 reject: missing model value for (f x)              | v2 accept
single_let_textkey         | v1 accept                                             | v2 accept
single_let_wrong           | v1 reject: missing model value for (f x)              | v2 reject: assertion is false: (let ((x a)) (= (f x) b))
ground_control             | v1 accept                                             | v2 accept
ground_control_wrong       | v1 reject: assertion is false: (= (f b) b)            | v2 reject: assertion is false: (= (f b) b)
alias_conflict             | v1 reject: congruence violation for f                 | v2 reject: congruence violation for f
alias_conflict_let         | v1 reject: missing model value for (f x)              | v2 reject: congruence violation for f
unused_conflict            | v1 accept                                             | v2 reject: congruence violation for f
shadow_textual             | v1 accept                                             | v2 reject: congruence violation for f
shadow_ground              | v1 reject: assertion is false: (let ((a b)) (= (f a) a)) | v2 accept
nested_keys_flat           | v1 reject: missing model value for (f x)              | v2 reject: missing model value for (f x)
nested_keys_deep           | v1 reject: missing model value for (f x)              | v2 accept
